# Spectral — 80 bpm, D minor. A demo of the spectral inserts: one track
# morphing into another, a freeze, blur, a frequency shift and a pitch
# shift, a gate and a tilt across the whole mix bus.
#
#   beats  0-8    PAD     a pad, blurred so every chord change smears in
#   beats  8-16   MORPH   the pad's spectrum crossfades into a muted
#                         cassette choir's, and is caught at beat 16
#   beats 16-24   FREEZE  the caught chord holds while a bell line plays
#                         through a +7 semitone spectral pitch shift
#   beats 24-32   SHIFT   the held chord's partials slide 150 Hz up, out
#                         of harmony; the bus gate thins the mix to its
#                         strongest partials and the tilt darkens it;
#                         the freeze lets go over the last two beats

bpm 80
gate 0.95
tail 4

section PAD 0..8
section MORPH 8..16
section FREEZE 16..24
section SHIFT 24..32

automate reverb_wet
0.2

track voice patch=cassette-choir gain=0
[D3 A3 F4]:16 [D3 A3 F4]:16

track pad patch=aurora vel=0.7 spec_from=voice spec_blur=0.6
[D3 A3 E4]:4 [Bb2 F3 D4]:4 [C3 G3 E4]:4 [A2 E3 C#4]:4 [D3 A3 E4]:16
automate pad.spec_morph
0 >8 1:8@smooth
automate pad.spec_freeze
0 >16 1 >30 0:2@smooth
automate pad.spec_shift
0 >24 150:6@smooth

track bell patch=glintbell vel=0.6 spec_pitch=7 spec_mix=0.7
R:16 (A4 . D5 . F5 . E5 .)x2

automate spec_gate
0 >24 30:4@smooth
automate spec_tilt
0 >24 -3:4@smooth
